<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="s-label reveal">FAQ</div>
  <h2 class="s-title reveal stagger-1">Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Do I need math skills or design experience?<span class="faq-arrow">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">No. If you can count stitches, you have everything you need. The system walks you through each step in plain language, and the calculator does the math for you.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What if my body doesn't fit neatly into one size?<span class="faq-arrow">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">That's exactly what this is for. The guide teaches you to adjust specific sections independently, so your bust, waist, and hips each get the right fit. Most bodies don't fit one size — that's the whole point.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Will adjusting the pattern ruin the stitch design?<span class="faq-arrow">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Not when you follow the system. The Pattern Integrity Shield shows you how to add or remove stitches in the right multiples, keeping cables centered and lace seamless.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Does this work for raglan, yoke, and seamed sweaters?<span class="faq-arrow">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Yes. The Construction-Type Cheat Sheets bonus covers the most common sweater builds, so the method applies no matter which style you're making.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What if I try it and my garment still doesn't fit?<span class="faq-arrow">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">You're covered by the "Wear It With Pride" Guarantee. Follow the system, and if your next garment doesn't fit better than anything you've made before, you get a full refund — and you keep the guide.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">How long does it take to go through the guide?<span class="faq-arrow">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Most makers work through the core system in one evening. You can apply it to your next project right away.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">Is this suitable for beginners?<span class="faq-arrow">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">Yes, as long as you can follow a basic pattern and take your measurements. You don't need advanced skills, just the right process.</div></div>
    <div class="faq-item reveal"><button class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">What if I can't find the yarn the pattern recommends?<span class="faq-arrow">+</span></button><div class="faq-a">The Yarn Substitution Masterclass bonus handles exactly that. It shows you how to swap yarns without throwing off your fit. Included free in The Complete Maker's Kit.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>
